    ('phd-agricultural-sciences', 'PhD in Agricultural Sciences', 'A research doctorate in an agricultural-science branch, typically 3-5 years, for candidates aiming at agricultural-university faculty roles or senior research positions at ICAR institutes.', 'flask', 'Eligibility usually requires clearing ICAR AIEEA-PG or a university-specific research entrance test after a master''s degree, plus identifying a research area and prospective guide.'),
    ('bhm', 'BHM', 'A 4-year undergraduate degree (Bachelor of Hotel Management), entered after 12th, covering front-office, food & beverage, housekeeping and hospitality operations.', 'building', 'Admission is through NCHM JEE (for NCHMCT-affiliated institutes) or university-specific/state entrance tests, testing numerical, reasoning, English and general-knowledge aptitude.'),
    ('bhmct', 'BHMCT', 'A 4-year undergraduate degree (Bachelor of Hotel Management and Catering Technology), broadly equivalent to a BHM with an added catering-technology and culinary-science focus.', 'building', 'Admission is through NCHM JEE or university-specific entrance tests, similar to BHM.'),
    ('bsc-hospitality-management', 'B.Sc Hospitality Management', 'A 3-year undergraduate science degree covering hotel and broader hospitality-sector operations and management, entered after 12th.', 'building', 'Admission is largely 12th-marks-based or via institute-specific entrance tests.'),
    ('bsc-hotel-management', 'B.Sc Hotel Management', 'A 3-year undergraduate science degree focused specifically on hotel operations and management, entered after 12th -- a lighter-weight alternative to the 4-year BHM.', 'building', 'Admission is largely 12th-marks-based or via institute-specific entrance tests.'),
