    ('mttm', 'MTTM', 'A 2-year postgraduate degree (Master of Tourism and Travel Management), entered after a bachelor''s degree, deepening tourism-industry strategy, destination management and travel-business operations.', 'plane', 'Admission is through university-specific entrance tests covering general aptitude and tourism-industry awareness.'),
    ('msc-hospitality-management', 'M.Sc Hospitality Management', 'A 2-year postgraduate science degree deepening hospitality-sector strategy and operations, usually entered after a B.Sc/BHM in hospitality or hotel management.', 'building', 'Admission is through institute-specific entrance tests.'),
